{"id":"posibilidad","lemma":"posibilidad","pos":"noun","rank":1011,"glosses":["possibility","means","potential, chance, odds, opportunity"],"ipa":"/posibiliˈdad/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"posibilidades"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/1/14/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-posibilidad.wav","examples":[{"text":"Es una posibilidad.","en":"I think it's a possibility.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/611745","words":[{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"a"},null]},{"text":"Pensaba que podría ser una posibilidad.","en":"I thought it might be a possibility.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/560080","words":[{"g":"to think, ponder","l":"pensar"},{"g":"that"},{"g":"to be able to, can","l":"poder"},{"g":"to be"},{"g":"a"},null]},{"text":"Tenemos pocas posibilidades de ganar.","en":"We have little chance of winning.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/353786","words":[{"g":"to have","l":"tener"},{"g":"little, not much","l":"poco"},null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"to gain"}]},{"text":"Tengo que pensar sobre las posibilidades.","en":"I have to think about the possibilities.","words":[{"g":"to have","l":"tener"},{"g":"that"},{"g":"to think, ponder"},{"g":"envelope"},{"g":"the / them"},null]},{"text":"Supongo que esa es una posibilidad.","en":"I suppose that's a possibility.","words":[{"g":"to suppose","l":"suponer"},{"g":"that"},{"g":"that","l":"ese"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"a"},null]}]}